  "vector_memory": {
    "semantic_summary": "ShaderSources acts as a centralized, static registry for all shader file paths within the rendering engine. It provides two read-only maps, 'frag' and 'vertex', which map descriptive symbolic names to their corresponding relative asset paths. This abstraction decouples rendering logic from hardcoded file paths, serving as a critical configuration utility for the graphics pipeline manager. It exclusively stores string constants and has no runtime side effects."
  },
